  "description": "A runaway noble lady, now a maid at an inn. \n\nMeryl Parte, the Count's only daughter, escapes an unwanted marriage and flees to Harp Island to keep a promise to her late mother. After a night at the rundown inn Dragondaily, she wakes up penniless and in bed with a mysterious man! He offers to help her, but only if she works as the inn's maid! \n\n(Source: Manta)",
